2DA V1.0
*
# ethren (M3.1): how a new peasant looks, by species and sex (the funnel's rolling screen, FunnelRoll.py;
# the M2.11 sprites, DCC/Looks.h). ANIM is the animation id (avatars.2da, decimal): the demihumans use the
# human bodies until their sprites exist (0x6501 CPM2, the bald male body with the hair and beard overlays;
# 0x6510 CPF1, the female with her hair baked in). HAIR lists the hair styles of dcchair.2da it may take (|
# between them, 0 the body's own); BALD and BEARD are the chances in % of no hair overlay and of a beard
# (BEARDS the beard styles). The colour columns are ranges of Ethren's pal16 rows: SKIN, HAIRCOL, the dyes of
# the minor and major colours (DYES), LEATHER and METAL (metal and armor).
            ANIM    HAIR  BALD  BEARD  BEARDS  SKIN   HAIRCOL  DYES   LEATHER  METAL
